{"id":"11cf093a6460aae2","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-interpretability.md","title":"Consistency Transfer Along Interpretations","display":"thm-interpretability — Consistency Transfer Along Interpretations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-interpretability","aliases":["67-thm-interpretability"],"display":"thm-interpretability — Consistency Transfer Along Interpretations","depends_on":["[[67-df-interpretability]]","[[67-df-consistent]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，印刷页 76；PDF 第 87 页","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"已核对第 76 页该段完整证明；未检查无限理论内部一致性转移（此处未声称）","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-interpretability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-interpretability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-interpretability — Consistency Transfer Along Interpretations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，印刷页 76；PDF 第 87 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"已核对第 76 页该段完整证明；未检查无限理论内部一致性转移（此处未声称）"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是有效呈现的算术公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 是外部一致性谓词（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a>），不是理论内一致性句。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(S\\unlhd T\\land\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T))\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(S\\unlhd T\\land\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T))\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源证明已核对：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 不一致，任取句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\varphi\\land\\neg\\varphi\">\\(S\\vdash\\varphi\\land\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>。解释保持定理、合取和否定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\tau\\varphi\\land\\neg\\tau\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash\\tau\\varphi\\land\\neg\\tau\\varphi\\)</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致冲突。</p>\n<p>该证明不需额外指定一个被翻译逐字保持的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 符号；原书正是用相反句的合取。对无限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，此元语言结论不自动推出 PA 内的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\\to\\mathrm{Con}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\to\\mathrm{Con}_S\\)</span>（第 76 页 Corollary 1 及其后说明）。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，本次用户提供 PDF；第 6 章 §1，印刷页 76；PDF 第 87 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：已核对第 76 页该段完整证明；未检查无限理论内部一致性转移（此处未声称）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是有效呈现的算术公理集，$\\unlhd$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 是外部一致性谓词（[[67-df-consistent]]），不是理论内一致性句。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"(S\\unlhd T\\land\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T))\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\varphi\\land\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\tau\\varphi\\land\\neg\\tau\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_T\\to\\mathrm{Con}_S","display":false}],"bytes":1752,"backlinks":[{"id":"16686ac2c7343b20","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-interpretability]]"}],"outgoing":["44cd21d3d12e4d8d","9f0e08fd1022847c"]}